title Home Assistant 0.3.0: Settings > Dashboard: "Automatic (Home)"; Enter moves to the next: the dashboard by name (the map-only one is never offered), then "Off (tiles only)": back on the dashboard the tabs start with Favourites
sizes 480x320 640x480 800x480 1024x600 1280x720 1280x800 720x720 480x800 480x640 800x1280
env HA_DEMO dash

wait 1800
key pgdn
key pgdn
key pgdn
key pgdn
key pgdn
wait 600
key end
key enter
wait 500
expect text "Dashboard"
shot settings-auto
check settings-auto
key home
key down
key down
key enter
wait 400
expect text "Home"
shot settings-home
check settings-home
key enter
wait 400
@640x480,800x480,1024x600,1280x720,1280x800,720x720,480x800,480x640,800x1280 expect text "Off (tiles only)"
shot settings-off
check settings-off
key esc
wait 800
expect text "Favourites"
expect notext "Lamp"
shot dash-off
check dash-off
expect noquit
